      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "THINK BACK (6) sets the standard off a sound third in CL2 company at Scone, where she was sent out favourite and was beaten a length and a half. Her Highway run prior also reads well for this grade, and the return to 1450m suits. She's a track and trip winner in the past and with her racing pattern, she'll be very hard to reel in with the blinkers back on. DREYMON (7) has been around the mark without winning, with the apprentice claim helping after a fair fifth at Port Macquarie and while he draws better today, though WANDJAD beat him clearly at Tuncurry. WANDJAD (4) brings winning form from that Tuncurry Benchmark 58, drops 2kg from that run and is proven around this trip. ZUBBA STORM (2) ticks a few boxes getting out to this trip.",
